          "source_type": "pdf",
          "location_type": "page",
          "location_number": 5,
          "text": "Artificial Intelligence - Definition\n• Artificial\nIntelligence\nis\nan\narea\nof\nComputer Science that emphasizes the\ncreation of intelligent machines that work\nand react like humans.\n• Artificial\nIntelligence\nis\nintelligence\nexhibited by machines, rather than the\nhumans or animals.",
          "content_hash": "daff4f687939da4ab081fd594152aaff829296dc13fa7166ce3d8fee1b9f9777",
          "ocr_regions": null
        },
